flowchart TD
    Start([Agent turn starts]) --> ValidateOpt{Validate changes\nenabled?}

    ValidateOpt -->|No| PlainPrompt[Skip bootstrap and\nvalidation prompt]
    ValidateOpt -->|Yes| RepoIDs{Repo resolved through\nGitHub App with install_id\nand repo_id?}
    RepoIDs -->|No| PlainPrompt
    RepoIDs -->|Yes| GetSpec[Get repo_setup_spec\nby installation_id, repo_id, path='']

    GetSpec -->|Spec exists| UseSpec[Use saved spec as-is\nany current status]
    GetSpec -->|Not found| CreateSession[Create bootstrap session\ninside the fresh sandbox]
    GetSpec -->|DB error| BootstrapSkipped[Log warning and\nrun without validation spec]

    CreateSession --> Clone[Run setup-clone.sh\nclone repo into SF_WORKDIR]
    Clone --> Detect[detectViaSandbox\ncopy detection files locally\nbootstrap.Detect]
    Detect --> Secrets[Load repo_secret_values\nand decrypt supplied secrets]
    Secrets --> Prompt[Build bootstrap prompt\nhints + supplied secret names]
    Prompt --> Loop[bootstrap.Run\nClaude Code Opus/high]

    Loop --> Artifacts[Agent writes\n/tmp/hetchy-spec/manifest.json\nsetup.sh, start.sh, stop.sh,\nhealth.sh, lessons.md]
    Artifacts --> Verify[Bootstrap harness runs\nsetup.sh, stop.sh, start.sh, health.sh]

    Verify -->|validated or partial| SaveSpec[Save repo_setup_spec\nstatus validated/partial\nsource fingerprint]
    Verify -->|loop failed with partial output| SaveFailing[Persist StatusFailing\npartial scripts + log]
    Verify -->|fatal error| BootstrapSkipped

    SaveSpec --> DeclareSecrets[Declare required secrets\nin repo_secret_values]
    DeclareSecrets --> UseSpec
    SaveFailing --> BootstrapSkipped

    UseSpec --> MintSlots[Mint default artifact slots\nif S3 is configured]
    MintSlots --> MergePrompt[Merge validation prompt\ninto agent prompt]
    MergePrompt --> ApplySpec[agent.sh/followup.sh decodes\nsetup/start/stop/health scripts\nand lessons.md]
    ApplySpec --> StartApp[Run setup.sh,\nstop.sh, start.sh,\npoll health.sh for 90s]
    StartApp --> AgentWork[Claude implements change\nand validates with proof]
    PlainPrompt --> AgentWork
    BootstrapSkipped --> AgentWork

    AgentWork --> Reflection{Fresh run succeeded\nand spec was used?}
    Reflection -->|Yes| ReadImprovements[Read /tmp/hetchy-spec/improved\nsetup/start/stop/health/lessons/reason or none.txt]
    Reflection -->|No| Done([Done])

    ReadImprovements -->|none.txt| MarkApplied[Mark spec applied\nstatus validated\nincrement success_count]
    ReadImprovements -->|scripts changed| SaveImproved[Save spec_version+1\nstatus stale\npatched scripts]
    ReadImprovements -->|no marker| MarkApplied
    SaveImproved --> MarkApplied
    MarkApplied --> Done

    Note1["Today, drift detection and AutoHeal helpers exist in internal/bootstrap,\nbut ensureBootstrapSpec does not call them. The launch path only\nbootstraps when no spec row exists; saved specs are reused directly.\nSpec-improvement readback is wired after successful PR-producing runs."]

    GetSpec -.-> Note1

